<title>UK: Prism Rail names Fearnley chief executive.</title>
<headline>Prism Rail names Fearnley chief executive.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>British railway operator Prism Rail Plc said on Monday it had appointed Giles Fearnley as chief executive.  </p>
<p>Fearnley is a founder shareholder and director of Prism.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
